# Only app.yaml, main.py, requirements.txt, and dist/ (the built site) are
# needed to deploy. Everything else here is excluded so gcloud doesn't waste
# time/quota uploading source files, tooling, and node_modules.
#
# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT excluded here even though it's in
# .gitignore — gcloud reads this file instead of .gitignore, so dist/ (the
# build output) gets uploaded as expected. Run `pnpm build && pnpm postbuild`
# before `gcloud app deploy` so dist/ is up to date.

.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
.github/
.vscode/
.zed/
.astro/
node_modules/
content/
src/
public/
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
*.config.ts
*.config.js
biome.json
tsconfig.json
.prettierrc.js
.prettierignore
.editorconfig
.nvmrc
README.md
LICENSE
